#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:8
msgid "Slash commands"
msgstr "슬래시 명령어"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:10
msgid ""
"Slash commands are available for collaborative playbooks. The "
"``/playbook`` slash command allows interaction with incidents via the "
"post textbox on desktop, browser, and mobile. To run a playbook use the "
"``/playbook run`` slash command from any channel."
msgstr ""
"협업 플레이북에서는 슬래시 명령어를 사용할 수 있습니다. ``/playbook`` 슬래시 "
"명령어를 사용하면 데스크톱, 브라우저, 모바일의 글 입력창에서 인시던트와 "
"상호작용할 수 있습니다. 플레이북을 실행하려면 아무 채널에서나 ``/playbook "
"run`` 슬래시 명령어를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:12
msgid "Available slash commands include:"
msgstr "사용할 수 있는 슬래시 명령어는 다음과 같습니다:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:14
msgid "``/playbook run`` - Run a playbook."
msgstr "``/playbook run`` - 플레이북을 실행합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:15
msgid "``/playbook finish`` - Finish the playbook run in this channel."
msgstr "``/playbook finish`` - 이 채널의 플레이북 런을 종료합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:16
msgid "``/playbook update`` - Provide a status update."
msgstr "``/playbook update`` - 상태 업데이트를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:17
msgid ""
"``/playbook check [checklist #] [item #]`` - Check/uncheck the checklist "
"item."
msgstr ""
"``/playbook check [checklist #] [item #]`` - 체크리스트 항목을 "
"체크/체크 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:18
msgid "``/playbook checkadd [checklist #] [item text]`` - Add a checklist item."
msgstr ""
"``/playbook checkadd [checklist #] [item text]`` - 체크리스트 항목을 "
"추가합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:19
msgid ""
"``/playbook checkremove [checklist #] [item #]`` - Remove a checklist "
"item."
msgstr ""
"``/playbook checkremove [checklist #] [item #]`` - 체크리스트 항목을 "
"제거합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:20
msgid "``/playbook owner [@username]`` - Show or change the current owner."
msgstr "``/playbook owner [@username]`` - 현재 소유자를 표시하거나 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:21
msgid "``/playbook info`` - Show a summary of the current playbook run."
msgstr "``/playbook info`` - 현재 플레이북 런의 요약을 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:22
msgid "``/playbook timeline`` - Show the timeline for the current playbook run."
msgstr "``/playbook timeline`` - 현재 플레이북 런의 타임라인을 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:23
msgid "``/playbook todo`` - Get a list of your assigned tasks."
msgstr "``/playbook todo`` - 자신에게 할당된 작업 목록을 가져옵니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:24
msgid "``/playbook settings digest [on/off]`` - Turn daily digest on/off."
msgstr "``/playbook settings digest [on/off]`` - 일일 요약을 켜거나 끕니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:25
msgid "``/playbook settings weekly-digest [on/off]`` - Turn weekly digest on/off."
msgstr "``/playbook settings weekly-digest [on/off]`` - 주간 요약을 켜거나 끕니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:28
msgid "Playbooks on the go"
msgstr "이동 중 플레이북 사용"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:30
msgid ""
"Learn how to `access and work with playbooks on the go "
"<https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide/workflow-automation.html#itab"
"--Mobile--0_1-Mobile>`_ with the Mattermost mobile app."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 모바일 앱으로 `이동 중에 플레이북에 접근하고 사용하는 방법 "
"<https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide/workflow-automation.html#itab"
"--Mobile--0_1-Mobile>`_\\ 을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:33
msgid "API documentation"
msgstr "API 문서"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:35
msgid ""
"To interact with the data model programmatically, consult the `REST API "
"specification <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-incident-"
"collaboration/blob/master/server/api/api.yaml>`_."
msgstr ""
"데이터 모델과 프로그래밍 방식으로 상호작용하려면 `REST API 사양 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-incident-"
"collaboration/blob/master/server/api/api.yaml>`_\\ 을 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/interact-with-playbooks.rst:37
msgid ""
"Playbooks help streamline and manage complex processes while decreasing "
"the risk of forgotten steps or tasks. They also support tool integration,"
" status updates in a dedicated channel, and can be edited on the fly. "
"When a playbook run is finished, you can review the entire run to assess "
"any areas of improvement for the next run."
msgstr ""
"플레이북은 복잡한 프로세스를 간소화하고 관리하면서 단계나 작업을 빠뜨릴 "
"위험을 줄여 줍니다. 또한 도구 통합과 전용 채널의 상태 업데이트를 지원하며, "
"실시간으로 편집할 수 있습니다. 플레이북 런이 끝나면 전체 런을 검토해 다음 "
"런에서 개선할 부분을 평가할 수 있습니다."

